comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T08:13:29.427Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live all-status census read 2829 items with completeness complete and no omissions. Title and keyword searches plus full pm-jb1ron metadata identify completed equal-link idempotency work but no owner for GH-1334 revised-note loss. Source https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1334."
  "2026-09-28T08:22:19.515Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: files and docs regressions both failed because changed was false for revised note. Shared SDK merge now replaces only explicitly supplied non-empty notes for matching normalized path/scope; bare and equal retries preserve note and history bytes. Focused files/docs suite passed 34 tests and new persistence tests passed."
  "2026-09-28T08:40:46.666Z","harness:codex","Focused post-fix verification: all 222 tests across 11 affected integration and contract suites passed. Unchanged invocation-profile and source-scanning timeout cases pass without the competing tracker scan. Full static and canonical full-source coverage remain pending; no threshold, timeout, coverage inclusion, or ignore-directive relaxation was made."
  "2026-09-28T09:35:46.265Z","harness:codex","Canonical full-source coverage passed: 9388 tests, 750 files, exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts; two Windows-only tests skipped on Linux. Temporary Node/Bun acceptance verified explicit note replacement and unchanged retry history. Packed npx/bunx smoke, security scan, version consistency and docs/skills gate passed."
  "2026-09-28T09:58:45.947Z","harness:codex","PR 1335 Greptile finding reproduced: migration collision creates duplicate identities, first-match note replacement is discarded by last-wins deduplication. Added real files/docs collision cases; all three extended regressions failed before corrections. The merge now revises the last surviving match, preserving existing dedupe ordering semantics."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T08:46:04.058Z","harness:codex",Idempotency must compare semantic state after merging explicit evidence revisions. Identity deduplication alone loses corrected notes. The regression must verify both one changed history event and exact history-byte stability for bare or equal retries.
